1
00:00:00,830 --> 00:00:07,550
Welcome to Supply Flow. This video shows nurses everything they need, step by step, in a simple way.

2
00:00:08,001 --> 00:00:12,871
Open the system link. Write your name and your password, then tap Sign in.

3
00:00:13,389 --> 00:00:17,821
On the New request page, there are three choices at the top. One:

4
00:00:17,821 --> 00:00:23,276
Doctor request, for everything used in the clinics. The doctor approves it. Two:

5
00:00:23,276 --> 00:00:29,209
Clinic consumables, only for Sterilization, the Triage room and the derma device rooms.

6
00:00:29,209 --> 00:00:35,209
No doctor approval is needed. Three: Send to lab, for patient work that goes to the lab.

7
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:40,341
Let's start with a Doctor request. First choose the clinic, then the doctor.

8
00:00:40,341 --> 00:00:46,869
The doctors of this clinic are listed first, then all other doctors, because doctors move between clinics.

9
00:00:46,869 --> 00:00:48,840
The branch is filled in for you.

10
00:00:49,291 --> 00:00:55,651
Choose the type. Monthly is your normal monthly order. Emergency is only for urgent needs.

11
00:00:56,103 --> 00:01:01,573
Now add the items. Tap the search box, write part of the name, and tap the item.

12
00:01:02,949 --> 00:01:05,899
Use plus and minus to set how many you need.

13
00:01:06,743 --> 00:01:14,183
Check the summary on the side, then tap Submit request. Your draft is saved by itself, so you never lose your work.

14
00:01:14,633 --> 00:01:19,742
Next, Clinic consumables. This is only for Sterilization and the Triage room.

15
00:01:19,742 --> 00:01:24,453
Open the list and choose the place in your branch: Buraydah or Unayzah.

16
00:01:24,904 --> 00:01:30,655
A note shows exactly where the order will be delivered. Add the items and tap Submit request.

17
00:01:30,655 --> 00:01:32,634
It goes straight to procurement.

18
00:01:33,488 --> 00:01:40,163
Now open My requests and see the difference. The doctor request shows Doctor review: it waits for the doctor.

19
00:01:40,163 --> 00:01:44,388
The sterilization request shows New: it went straight to procurement.

20
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:51,700
Tap Details to see everything about a request: each step and its time, the items, and the comments.

21
00:01:52,151 --> 00:01:57,388
The doctor gets an email automatically. Ask the doctor to open their page and approve.

22
00:01:57,388 --> 00:02:00,311
You can also write a comment here as a reminder.

23
00:02:00,762 --> 00:02:05,782
This is the doctor's page. The doctor sees the requests that are waiting for approval.

24
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:15,630
The doctor opens the request. The doctor can change a quantity or add a note, and then taps Approve.

25
00:02:16,099 --> 00:02:20,074
After approval, procurement sends the order in the doctor's box.

26
00:02:20,074 --> 00:02:26,719
When the driver delivers the box to your branch, you get an alert, and the card turns to Arrived at branch.

27
00:02:26,719 --> 00:02:29,079
The Arrived chip shows these requests.

28
00:02:31,259 --> 00:02:37,269
When the box arrives, open My requests and tap Receive and sign. Check each quantity.

29
00:02:37,269 --> 00:02:40,309
If something is missing, change the number.

30
00:02:40,761 --> 00:02:46,951
Sign in the box with your finger, then tap Confirm receipt. A receipt with your signature is saved.

31
00:02:47,406 --> 00:02:52,171
Sometimes procurement cancels a request, for example when an item is not available.

32
00:02:52,171 --> 00:02:57,222
The card shows Cancelled and the reason, and you get an email, so you don't wait for it.

33
00:02:57,222 --> 00:02:59,576
Raise a new request if you still need it.

34
00:03:00,027 --> 00:03:06,415
Now, sending work to the lab. Choose Send to lab, choose the doctor, and write the patient file number.

35
00:03:06,415 --> 00:03:10,757
The scan date is today. Change it only if the scan was on another day.

36
00:03:11,208 --> 00:03:17,311
Add the work: choose the lab, the type of work, and write notes, like the tooth number and the shade.

37
00:03:17,311 --> 00:03:22,508
You can add a photo for each work. The date the lab must finish is calculated for you.

38
00:03:22,958 --> 00:03:26,608
Tap Send to lab. Now you can follow it on the Lab page.

39
00:03:27,079 --> 00:03:30,351
For an iTero digital scan, choose the iTero tab.

40
00:03:30,351 --> 00:03:37,848
Write the scan date, the iTero case number, the file number and the doctor. Then choose the lab from the list:

41
00:03:37,848 --> 00:03:41,529
the internal lab, or an external lab. Tap Send to lab.

42
00:03:42,761 --> 00:03:48,650
When the lab finishes, it sends the work back to the clinic. You will see the button Confirm receipt.

43
00:03:48,650 --> 00:03:51,041
Tap it when the work reaches your clinic.

44
00:03:51,491 --> 00:03:56,460
That's all. Clinic supplies are a Doctor request, approved by the doctor.

45
00:03:56,460 --> 00:04:03,336
Sterilization and the Triage room are Clinic consumables. Patient work and iTero scans go to the lab.

46
00:04:03,336 --> 00:04:08,101
If there is any problem, use the Report button on the card. Thank you!
